rgba(255,255,255,0.12); padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #86bc25; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 6px;\">01</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;\">Submit Details</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: #cfd6cf;\">Choose claim type, incident date, severity, region, and claim amount.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #86bc25; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 6px;\">02</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;\">Attach Documents</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: #cfd6cf;\">Add invoices, reports, photos, medical files, or other supporting evidence.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #86bc25; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 6px;\">03</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;\">Track Progress</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: #cfd6cf;\">Follow claim state from New to Review, Investigation, Approval, or Closure.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>"
	}
}]]></widget_parameters>
